form-hint-plc-module-safety-f-wd-ms = How long the module waits for a valid safety message before it switches off, in ms, such as 150.
form-hint-plc-channel-settings-mode = What a port that can be an input or an output is used as, such as input.
form-hint-plc-channel-settings-evaluation = How a safety input reads its sensor, such as 1oo2 (two channels, one must agree).
